    "<div><div>\n <div><strong>🎧 FILE NGHE – LISTENING</strong><span>Chưa phát</span></div>\n \n <div><span>0:00</span><span>0:00</span></div>\n  ______ \n <div>\n  ______ </div>\n </div></div>\n        <div>\n          <div>\n            <span></span>\n            <h3>PART 1: LISTENING (2.4pts)</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span>12 câu • 2.4 điểm</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- LISTENING PART I -->\n        <div>\n          <div>\n            <p>\n              I. You will hear an interview with Mark . Listen and circle A, B or C to indicate the correct answer. You will listen TWICE. (1.2 pts)\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Custom Audio Player Bar for Listening I -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Hidden Transcript for Listening I -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Questions 1-6 for Listening I -->\n          <div>\n\n            <!-- L1 Q1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- L1 Q2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- L1 Q3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- L1 Q4 (Phương án là câu dài => Không đặt loa trước khi nộp để tránh lộ đáp án) -->\n            \n\n            <!-- L1 Q5 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- L1 Q6 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- LISTENING PART II -->\n        <div>\n          <div>\n            <p>\n              II. You will hear a conversation betweem Mai and Nick . Listen and circle A, B or C to indicate the correct answer. You will listen TWICE. (1.2 pt)\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Audio Player for Listening II -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Hidden Transcript for Listening II -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Questions 1-6 for Listening II -->\n          <div>\n\n            <!-- L2 Q1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- L2 Q2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- L2 Q3 (Đã sửa lỗi hiển thị ., Mai -> ______ , Mai) -->\n            \n\n            <!-- L2 Q4 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- L2 Q5 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- L2 Q6 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <div>\n            <span></span>\n            <h3>PART 2: USE OF LANGUAGE (2.6pts)</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span>13 câu • 2.6 điểm</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SECTION I: PRONUNCIATION (Liền mạch, gạch chân rõ nét) -->\n        <div>\n          <p>\n            I. Choose the word whose underlined part is pronounced differently from the others. (0.6pt)\n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            <!-- P1: choose / cool / good / tool -->\n            \n\n            <!-- P2: busy / picturesque / support / campus -->\n            \n\n            <!-- P3: curious / plural / during / pure -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SECTION II: VOCAB & GRAMMAR (Đã thêm đầy đủ blank ______ rõ ràng) -->\n        <div>\n          <p>\n            II. Choose the best answer for each of the following sentences. (1.4pt)\n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            <!-- MC 1: Đã bổ sung blank ______ rõ ràng -->\n            \n\n            <!-- MC 2: Đã bổ sung blank ______ rõ ràng -->\n            \n\n            <!-- MC 3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- MC 4: Đã bổ sung blank ______ rõ ràng -->\n            \n\n            <!-- MC 5 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- MC 6 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- MC 7 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SECTION III: VERB FORM -->\n        <div>\n          <p>\n            III- Put the correct form of the verbs in the blank . (0.6pt)\n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            <!-- VF1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- VF2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- VF3 -->\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <div>\n            <span></span>\n            <h3>PART 3: READING (2.6 pts)</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span>10 câu • 2.6 điểm</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- READING I: CLOZE TEST -->\n        <div>\n          <p>\n            I. Choose the word or phrase among A, B, C or D that best fits the blank space in the following passage. (1.0 pt)\n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            <p>\n              There are a lot of leisure activities that young people like, and one of <strong>(1) ______</strong> is mountain climbing. It is an active leisure activity that people can do either indoors or outdoors. If you go climbing outdoors, it is a great way to <strong>(2) ______</strong> your strength and enjoy nature at the same time. You can even set up your own climbing wall in your backyard or <strong>(3) ______</strong> your home. This way you don't have to go out and still can <strong>(4) ______</strong> fit and enjoy the activity.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              So how can you start mountain climbing? Many people take a class to learn how to climb and use their equipment <strong>(5) ______</strong>. Others join climbing clubs to make new friends with the same interest and go climbing together. If you are an active person and like outdoor activities, Why don't you try this activity?\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <!-- R1_1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- R1_2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- R1_3: Linh hoạt chấp nhận cả A (inside) và B (indoor), giải thích sư phạm rõ ràng -->\n            \n\n            <!-- R1_4 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- R1_5 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- READING II: READING COMPREHENSION -->\n        <div>\n          <p>\n            II. Read the following passage then answer the questions (1.6 pts):\n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            <p>\n              Living in the country is something that people from the city often dream about. However, in reality, it has both advantages and disadvantages.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              There are certainly many advantages of living in the country. First, you can enjoy peace and quietness. Moreover, people tend to be friendlier. A further advantage is that there is less traffic, so it is safer for young children.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              However, there are certain disadvantages or drawbacks to life outside the city. First, because there are fewer people, you are likely to have few friends. In addition, entertainment is difficult to find, particularly in the evening. Furthermore, the fact that there are fewer shops and services so it is quite hard to find jobs. As a result, you may have to travel a long way to work, which can be extremely expensive.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              In conclusion, it can be seen that the country is more suitable for some people than others. On the whole, it is often the best place for those who are retired or who have young children. In contrast, young or single people who have a career are better provided for in the city.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Section A: Answer the questions (1.2 pts) - Đã sửa placeholder trung lập tuyệt đối, không lộ bài -->\n          <div>\n            <h4>A. Answer the questions: (1,2 pts)</h4>\n\n            <!-- R2_A1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- R2_A2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- R2_A3: Sửa lỗi .? và thay placeholder bảo mật không lộ đáp án -->\n            \n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Section B: Choose the item among A, B, C or D (0.4 pt) - Đã bổ sung blank ______ ở cuối câu -->\n          <div>\n            <h4>Choose the item among A, B, C or D that best answers the question about the passage. (0,4 pt)</h4>\n\n            <!-- R2_B1: Đã thêm blank ______ -->\n            \n\n            <!-- R2_B2: Đã thêm blank ______ -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <div>\n            <span></span>\n            <div>\n              <h3>PART 4: WRITING</h3>\n              <p>Đã tự động loại bỏ phần viết đoạn văn theo yêu cầu</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <span>7 câu • 1.4 điểm</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- REARRANGE SECTION: CÁC BOX TỪ ĐÃ ĐƯỢC XÁO TRỘN, DẤU CHẤM TỰ XỬ LÝ -->\n        <div>\n          <div>\n            <p>\n              I. Rearrange these words to make meaningful sentences. (0.6pt)\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              👉 <em>Hướng dẫn: Bấm vào từng ô từ/cụm từ bên dưới theo thứ tự để ghép thành câu. Bấm vào từ trong khung trả lời để gỡ từ nếu muốn sửa. Dấu chấm cuối câu được hệ thống tự động xử lý.</em>\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Rearrange 1: Words are scrambled in word pool -->\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <span>1. into /Mai / are / Hoa/ in/ her / and /free time/ gardening/./</span>\n              \n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Answer Zone -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Source Word Boxes Pool (Xáo trộn, không lộ đáp án) -->\n            <div></div>\n            \n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Rearrange 2: Words are scrambled -->\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <span>2. A/ a/ camel / run / than / can /tiger/ faster/./</span>\n              \n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Answer Zone -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Source Word Boxes Pool (Xáo trộn, không lộ đáp án) -->\n            <div></div>\n            \n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Rearrange 3: Words are scrambled -->\n          <div>\n            <div>\n              <span>3. Some teenagers/ never /any forums for help / join in /because/ they / about their problems /prefer /talking to their parents/./</span>\n              \n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Answer Zone -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Source Word Boxes Pool (Xáo trộn, không lộ đáp án) -->\n            <div></div>\n            \n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- REWRITE SECTION: TỰ ĐỘNG CHẤM & GỢI Ý CHI TIẾT -->\n        <div>\n          <p>\n            II. Rewrite the second sentence so that it has a similar meaning to the first one (0.8pt)\n          </p>\n\n          <div>\n            <!-- RW1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- RW2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- RW3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- RW4 -->\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>"
